    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in\u00a0<i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and playstyles. Whether you prefer the berserker\u2019s brute force, the vampire hunter\u2019s cunning traps, or the pyromancer\u2019s elemental mayhem, there\u2019s a hero to unlock for every type of adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1753975917\" width=720 height=229 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your favourite pet to the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are the same. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=468 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game just as it was, with small quality of life improvements! Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, <i>Dungeon Rampage</i> was doomed to disappear when Flash was officially discontinued, rendering the game unplayable and leaving its 8 million player base without a home. We\u2019re restored the game to the original experience and are working on polishing and expanding the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in\u00a0<i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/9403d438f6399853cda8f811da5d6ecb.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your champion from a roster of unique heroes. Each hero has distinct abilities, weapons, and playstyles. Whether you prefer the berserker\u2019s brute force, the vampire hunter\u2019s cunning traps, or the pyromancer\u2019s elemental mayhem, there\u2019s a hero to unlock for every type of adventurer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f88829b2b6973f12f283e26a284e77f8.avif?t=1753975917\" width=720 height=229 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes to upgrade their abilities and customize your loadouts! With hundreds of different weapons to equip, you can fine-tune your build to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/bb7ab0b2fcfa94f494986806c613eaf5.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally up to 3 friends or match with players from the community and tear through dungeons teeming with deadly traps, ruthless enemies, and hidden treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/85b920951c815f0321239bdb182e8976.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your favourite pet to the battlefield and watch them destroy your enemies in your stead: take your pick between rhinos, wolves, dragons and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/33453bcfe5d2af1396232461940e2824.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=269 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are the same. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/0e0081e31d9f63720e66c2a4aada5405.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=468 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game just as it was, with small quality of life improvements! Originally released on Facebook in 2012 and shut down in 2017, <i>Dungeon Rampage</i> was doomed to disappear when Flash was officially discontinued, rendering the game unplayable and leaving its 8 million player base without a home. We\u2019re restored the game to the original experience and are working on polishing and expanding the content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the dungeon, rampagers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.poster.avif?t=1753975917\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.webm?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053950/extras/f4689e667fbec95c2732ede24c9de385.mp4?t=1753975917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the Dungeon... Join with up to 3 of your friends and battle your way to victory in this multiplayer coop hack n slash dungeon crawler. Unlock characters, earn powerful weapons and level-up as you rampage through a gauntlet of enemies and destruction, to end Lord Dinglepus' reign!",
